1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
How does motion become a braid?
Eight moving bobbins exchange places.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Follow the thread.
The spool pays out. The dancer stores slack.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Watch the crossings form.
The take-up carries those crossings into the cord.
